Every potential dimension of data variance has already been isolated into its own dedicated agent:
Time Horizon is Isolated. Forward curves (M1 to M12) and weather forecasts (Day 1 to Day 15) are completely separated so no agent ever handles a vector or array of dates.
Geography is Isolated. National totals are gone. Every major producing basin, cross-border interconnect, LNG liquefaction terminal, and EIA storage region has its own dedicated agent.
Metric Type is Isolated. High, low, midpoint, and volume are separated. Observed weather (Actual_HDD) is separated from climatological normals (30YrNormal) and raw model forecasts (GFS vs. ECMWF).
Formula Components are Isolated. Coal spot prices, rail tariffs, and carbon credits sit in separate agents rather than being pre-blended into a synthetic switching ratio.
